      "writtenOn": "2025-07-28T18:41:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do these need to be static? IIUC, the mock function only verify their expectations on destruction so making then static might prevent that from happening in the right places.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 380,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 382,
