      "writtenOn": "2025-07-30T10:08:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately I think at least `cacheMissFn` have to be static, since it is used in the cache miss handler of `LoadOrRun`, which requires such handler being a free function (i.e. no capture is allowed for lambda). I think that is why tests above use `static` mock function as well.",
      "parentUuid": "b388ab0a_0df4af3a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 380,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 382,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "6c8194ba8160c17499025a1c094aec8cd68f7c70",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0bedfdc0_74502fad",
        "filename": "src/dawn/tests/unittests/native/CacheRequestTests.cpp",
