      "writtenOn": "2025-07-31T06:22:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since the cache miss handler lambda need to call mock function `cacheMissFn` while can not capture it, I thought it have to be static.\n\nTo solve the issue, I made `cacheHitFn` and `cacheMissFn` both become `unique_ptr`, and construct/destruct them for every round of test, in this way we can ensure the expected behaviors happen in the right place.",
